a-anchor="/document/90/7219/dfasn7wa1b/"></a>Ҳар ойда</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/bssPhr190/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="190" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr190"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/dfasa3eiy5/"></a>бир марта</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdRight" style="width: 1%; height: 18.886px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/bssPhr191/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="191" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr191"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/dfasqkwae4/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight" style="width: 1%; height: 18.886px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/bssPhr192/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="192" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr192"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/dfasqw6spw/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight" style="width: 1%; height: 18.886px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/bssPhr193/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="193" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr193"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/dfas1knusk/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 6%; height: 18.886px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/bssPhr194/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="194" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr194"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/dfas34nz5r/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width: 7%; height: 18.886px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/bssPhr195/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="195" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr195"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7219/dfaswe5rqy/"></a>&#160;</td><td